                    'Page and monarch, forth they went, forth they went together,',
                    'Through the cold wind\'s wild lament and the bitter weather.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 4',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 4,
                'lines' => [
