                'label' => 'Verse 2',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 2,
                'lines' => [
                    'Love\'s redeeming work is done, Alleluia! Fought',
                    'the fight, the battle won, Alleluia! Lo!',
                    'the Sun\'s eclipse is o\'er, Alleluia! Lo!',
                    'He sets in blood no more, Alleluia!',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 3',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 3,
                'lines' => [
                    'Vain the stone, the watch, the seal,',
