O holiest Fire!
O Source
of rest!
Grant that with
joy and
hope possest,
And in
Thy service kept
forever, Naught us
from Thee
may sever. Lord,
may Thy pow\'r
prepare each heart;
To our weak
nature strength
impart, Onward
to press,
our foes
defying, To Thee,
through living and
through dying.
Hallelujah! Hallelujah!',
